Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.56,0:00:05.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做转体高臂托举
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.60,0:00:08.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,1 2 DOWN UP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.86,0:00:19.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再来一次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.78,0:00:22.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.41,0:00:26.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢教练
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.13,0:00:34.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.21,0:00:36.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.26,0:00:37.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.72,0:00:39.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们对教练太没礼貌了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.22,0:00:41.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.76,0:00:44.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,光梨 光梨
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.51,0:00:47.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么明明已读了却不回复呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.73,0:00:48.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,光梨？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.48,0:00:50.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你侵犯个人隐私
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.44,0:00:52.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你自己说的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.36,0:00:54.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弦 你知道些什么吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.23,0:00:56.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.44,0:00:58.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 等等 你明明知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.82,0:00:59.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.99,0:01:03.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,银 铜 一郎都怪怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.20,0:01:04.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.41,0:01:07.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.33,0:01:10.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 抱歉 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.60,0:01:36.02,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}结束漫不经心度过的每一天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.36,0:01:40.19,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}满心想要脱离现状
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.40,0:01:45.87,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我总是不敢踏出第一步
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.03,0:01:50.00,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}每次是你牵着我的手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.16,0:01:55.83,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}带我去看新的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.96,0:01:58.17,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}世界变幻
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.34,0:02:00.30,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}迈出最初一步
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.30,0:02:03.51,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}仿佛带来了变化
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.72,0:02:09.43,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}不再担心 我们在一起能去到任何地方
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.56,0:02:11.02,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}去吧 飞翔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.10,0:02:12.56,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}以最本真的模样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.73,0:02:15.77,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}虽然也有不安也有迷茫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.94,0:02:22.44,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}但有太多事情 不试试没法知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.57,0:02:23.99,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}去吧 飞翔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.11,0:02:28.95,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}伸手仿佛能触碰天空
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.08,0:02:32.08,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我们不再孤单
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.25,0:02:37.25,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}投身新世界
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.60,0:01:36.02,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}何気なく過ごしてる　日々に蓋してしまう
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.36,0:01:40.19,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}抜け出したい気持ちは山々です
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.40,0:01:45.87,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}初めの一歩目が　踏み出せない僕に
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.03,0:01:50.00,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}いつでも君が僕の手引っ張って
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.16,0:01:55.83,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}新しいモノを見に　連れて行ってくれる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.96,0:01:58.17,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}世界が変わる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.34,0:02:00.30,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}初めの一歩目で
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.30,0:02:03.51,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}変われた気がした
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.72,0:02:09.43,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}とこまでても行ける　もう大丈夫僕らなら
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.56,0:02:11.02,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}行け、飛べ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.10,0:02:12.56,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}ありのままで
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.73,0:02:15.77,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}不安も迷いもあるけれど
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.94,0:02:22.44,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}やってみなきゃわからない　事がたくさんあるんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.57,0:02:23.99,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}行け、飛べ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.11,0:02:28.95,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}あのそらに届きそうなぐらいに手を伸ばす
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.08,0:02:32.08,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}僕らはもう一人じゃない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.25,0:02:37.25,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}新しい世界に飛び込むのさ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.97,0:02:52.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一 出什么事了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.64,0:02:54.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.64,0:02:55.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.44,0:02:57.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚才只是在想
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.52,0:03:02.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了预赛提升了表演难度 那接下来的训练会很辛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.53,0:03:05.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长怎么能带头说丧气话
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.11,0:03:08.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也对 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.53,0:03:11.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西兰花转起来很轻松
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.24,0:03:15.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但一般情况下要把人转360度很困难吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.35,0:03:17.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说得没错 武酱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.31,0:03:18.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,武酱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.52,0:03:21.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卓巳 别见谁都加「酱」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.73,0:03:22.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了 哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.32,0:03:26.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,转体高臂托举动作有什么窍门吗 翔酱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.11,0:03:29.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,压根没明白
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.49,0:03:32.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,窍门啊 在抬起尖子的同时
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.41,0:03:37.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以脚跟为轴转动脚尖 这时候加上扭动的动作
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.67,0:03:39.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再说一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.75,0:03:40.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想听
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.17,0:03:44.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一 抱歉 我根本做不好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.26,0:03:46.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么才能转过去...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.22,0:03:47.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.05,0:03:51.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 我赶时间先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.56,0:04:01.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一果然不太对劲
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.07,0:04:09.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.70,0:04:20.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那什么...没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.12,0:04:22.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么没事？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.04,0:04:24.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么 随口一问
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.92,0:04:27.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还想问你 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.42,0:04:30.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,学园祭我去看了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.22,0:04:33.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一群男生做那种事情
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.43,0:04:36.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,屋顶上那些东西也是你们弄来的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.43,0:04:38.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.19,0:04:43.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.44,0:04:45.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.83,0:05:03.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一今天请假吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.21,0:05:05.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 跟我说过了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.05,0:05:06.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.05,0:05:09.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴 你知不知道怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.72,0:05:10.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.55,0:05:14.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,预赛就快到了 阿一这是怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.43,0:05:18.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 这会影响新加技巧的训练
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.31,0:05:22.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,男人就该直视前方
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.85,0:05:23.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.27,0:05:25.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看着别人的眼睛回答
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.27,0:05:27.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.82,0:05:30.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之先开始训练吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.44,0:05:32.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,集中精神 赶紧练完今天的项目
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.61,0:05:35.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弦是不是遇到开心的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.53,0:05:36.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪里 没有的事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.99,0:05:41.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉心神不宁的氛围蔓延开了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.96,0:05:42.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.25,0:05:44.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,究其原因...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.17,0:05:46.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原因？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.34,0:05:47.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是恋爱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.13,0:05:49.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我懂
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.59,0:05:50.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你懂啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.34,0:05:51.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没恋爱过吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.97,0:05:58.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,貌似是在谈恋爱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.48,0:06:03.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.19,0:06:04.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,光梨
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.10,0:06:06.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以说光梨是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.52,0:06:07.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.86,0:06:09.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一郎有妹妹啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.23,0:06:11.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长得可可爱了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.24,0:06:15.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然是可爱的妹妹 那就温暖地守护她咯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.57,0:06:19.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做不到啊 她今天貌似要去约会
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.54,0:06:21.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.58,0:06:25.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我担心啊 没忍住偷听了她打电话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.22,0:06:28.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,问她对方是谁她也不说
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.02,0:06:30.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被她知道我偷听她打电话之后
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.39,0:06:34.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最近我发的消息全被她无视了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.73,0:06:36.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我有个请求
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.61,0:06:41.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们应该是约在这里碰头
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.78,0:06:45.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来到妹妹的约会地点是要干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.78,0:06:47.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先观察一下男生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.66,0:06:50.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万一那小子不怀好意 就往死里揍他
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.91,0:06:54.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真揍了你妹妹会更加烦你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.62,0:06:57.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没妹妹所以不明白这心情
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.54,0:07:00.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要这么说的话 你可以拜托弦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.26,0:07:02.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.67,0:07:06.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弦最近感觉怪怪的 总是躲着我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.51,0:07:08.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一也不对劲
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.56,0:07:10.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道他们也...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.68,0:07:11.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谈恋爱？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.73,0:07:14.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一肯定不是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.94,0:07:17.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是有了喜欢的女生 他肯定会告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.40,0:07:20.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可爱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.07,0:07:26.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个 反差萌？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.91,0:07:28.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.78,0:07:31.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弦今天倒是好像特别兴奋
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.50,0:07:40.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那小子也约会？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.09,0:07:42.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弦 等很久了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.01,0:07:43.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,光梨
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.72,0:07:47.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,光梨 我也是刚来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.39,0:07:48.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.68,0:07:51.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你妹妹的男朋友是弦？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.89,0:07:54.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那小子敢对我妹妹出手
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.60,0:07:55.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.89,0:07:59.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天的衣服好可爱 很衬你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.44,0:08:04.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想去哪 去哪我都陪你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.65,0:08:06.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天我可是光梨的骑士
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.36,0:08:10.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,骑你妹个士啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.37,0:08:10.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一郎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.37,0:08:18.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.21,0:08:20.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一郎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.80,0:08:28.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,光梨给我挑的礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.80,0:08:33.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为她说不知道该送什么生日礼物给哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.06,0:08:35.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以约我出来帮她挑
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.10,0:08:37.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸好只是误会
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.44,0:08:41.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妹妹 浪漫得没边
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.48,0:08:42.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,误会
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.02,0:08:44.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也是误会吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.24,0:08:49.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高城教练发了这个过来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.32,0:08:51.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家集中注意力
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.62,0:08:54.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摇篮太松散了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.12,0:08:58.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这翔推视频哪来的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.29,0:09:01.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的 全都是翔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.21,0:09:06.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊 我觉得或许是发错了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.34,0:09:10.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我猜教练她是不是 喜、喜欢翔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.22,0:09:12.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.22,0:09:14.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我年长的也OK啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.43,0:09:17.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这事实在没法对金哥说
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.89,0:09:20.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但瞒着也着实难受
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.89,0:09:21.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.15,0:09:24.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴 想想办法吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.18,0:09:30.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给银发的视频？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.30,0:09:34.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 我发错了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.02,0:09:39.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个视频是特别发给翔的粉丝的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.60,0:09:41.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,粉丝？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.98,0:09:46.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先别告诉翔 下次我来解释
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.49,0:09:48.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.99,0:09:50.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然是误会
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.78,0:09:51.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.49,0:09:55.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都只是误会了而已
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.83,0:09:57.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一可能也...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.20,0:10:00.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 开始训练吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.50,0:10:02.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦 阿一呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.21,0:10:04.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又没来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.75,0:10:07.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也没联系我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.42,0:10:09.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没联系啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.34,0:10:12.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他跟你说过吗 阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.72,0:10:14.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.35,0:10:19.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一到结束都没来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.02,0:10:21.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也没发消息
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.19,0:10:23.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这也太不正常了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.31,0:10:25.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是出事了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.40,0:10:31.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一练柔道的时候 也没有连招呼都不打就不来训练
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.49,0:10:33.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前所未有的异变
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.66,0:10:36.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这果然是恋爱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.66,0:10:38.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像能懂
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.37,0:10:39.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能懂吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.91,0:10:41.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像能懂
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.54,0:10:42.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大哥
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.87,0:10:44.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和女朋友约会去了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.67,0:10:47.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说不定不太顺利
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.63,0:10:49.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被女朋友甩了太受打击于是请假？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.55,0:10:52.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,失恋吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.38,0:10:55.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一不可能因为这种事情就不来训练
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.72,0:10:58.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不对 未必就是恋爱了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.02,0:11:10.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去阿一家看看
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.61,0:11:11.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.82,0:11:13.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.24,0:11:17.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个 阿一好像去医院了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.95,0:11:22.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不放心 就跟踪了他
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.79,0:11:26.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说不定是阿一的外婆情况不好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.21,0:11:28.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,精神好着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.71,0:11:32.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苹果削几个她吃几个 我都没辙了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.55,0:11:35.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她啊 我一去就拉着我聊天 不让我回家
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.97,0:11:40.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了 我去医院
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.58,0:12:02.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.63,0:12:11.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多谢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.43,0:12:17.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,训练的事 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.60,0:12:25.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之前教练对我说 队长是队伍的太阳
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.19,0:12:29.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可现在的我发不出光来 所以...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.73,0:12:37.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都猜你是不是谈恋爱了 是不是被女朋友甩了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.66,0:12:38.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们真能扯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.24,0:12:43.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你外婆情况不太好？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.72,0:12:47.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直在撒谎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.19,0:12:53.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么爱吃苹果 拉着我喋喋不休不放我回家
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.44,0:12:56.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果外婆真是这样那该多好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.36,0:12:58.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可她
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.82,0:13:01.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经连我都不认识了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.66,0:13:06.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她忘的越来越多
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.33,0:13:09.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想不起来的东西越来越多
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.21,0:13:14.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可看到电视里啦啦队表演的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.42,0:13:16.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,kasu...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.80,0:13:23.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,霞
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.80,0:13:23.30,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,620)}kasumi
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.60,0:13:29.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她喊了妈妈的名字 霞
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.10,0:13:35.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽管那个啦啦队的姑娘跟妈妈一点都不像
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.77,0:13:39.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但当时我想如果能做出和妈妈一样的表演
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.57,0:13:42.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她说不定就能想起我了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.32,0:13:49.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想在学园祭上表演相同的内容
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.45,0:13:53.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴 我好几次想对你坦白
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.00,0:13:57.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 如果告诉你这才是我组建啦啦队的真正理由
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.00,0:14:02.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我又害怕一旦这个理由不存在了 我该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.68,0:14:04.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.35,0:14:06.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 现在不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.35,0:14:10.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经没有了继续啦啦队的理由
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.23,0:14:14.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 我因为自己的私心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.52,0:14:16.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说什么想开始新的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.32,0:14:19.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还说你应援的力量很强大
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.44,0:14:21.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至把其他人也牵连了进来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.91,0:14:28.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴 就剩我一个人了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.45,0:14:32.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的家人 看着我的人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.42,0:14:34.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个都没有了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.13,0:14:38.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一 看着我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.76,0:14:45.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一 你不是一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.93,0:14:48.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你并不像你想象得那么孤独
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.97,0:14:51.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算组建啦啦队的契机是你的外婆
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.10,0:14:54.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在你的周围也已经聚集起了众多队友
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.52,0:14:59.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都在看着你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.69,0:15:02.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还是太阳 明亮的太阳
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.15,0:15:03.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.70,0:15:05.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要哭了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.12,0:15:09.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别哭
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.00,0:15:18.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴 你不也哭了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.65,0:15:38.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你回来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.73,0:15:40.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.73,0:15:41.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回来得真晚
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.03,0:15:44.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃晚饭吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.11,0:15:48.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 最近阿一很少来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.47,0:15:53.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他很忙吗 以前常来家里吃饭的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.27,0:16:04.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一次看见阿一那样的表情
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.90,0:16:13.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是不是一直独自默默忍耐着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.41,0:16:21.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来是这样阿
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.62,0:16:27.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一总是表现得乐观开朗 所以没看出来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.21,0:16:30.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我根本没发现
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.38,0:16:33.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他故意瞒着大家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.14,0:16:37.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那家伙什么意思 我们是团队
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.22,0:16:40.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难过的时候不敢直说难过 这样的团队像什么话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.64,0:16:43.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦队不是最棒的团体竞技吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.69,0:16:47.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想他和大家在一起的时候 是真的开朗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.15,0:16:49.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想我能明白
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.73,0:16:52.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一开始执着于七个人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.28,0:16:55.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是因为想让外婆看到吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.66,0:16:58.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,表演和妈妈一样的内容也是为了...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.53,0:17:02.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样啊 学园祭的演出原来还有这层意义啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.46,0:17:04.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.83,0:17:08.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想为阿一加油
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.38,0:17:13.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想大家一起为他加油
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.76,0:17:16.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我也想
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.76,0:17:17.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为他加油
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.97,0:17:21.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想 因为家人是最重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.39,0:17:25.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我念初中高中的时候很自以为是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.98,0:17:27.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给家人添了不少麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.31,0:17:32.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说来渐愧 现在我才明自
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.90,0:17:34.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,家人有多么重要
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.03,0:17:35.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大哥
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.49,0:17:41.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人如果有能分担悲伤的朋友 悲伤就会痊愈
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.58,0:17:44.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是莎士比亚说的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.96,0:17:47.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是该怎么帮助他呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.04,0:17:49.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能做的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.38,0:17:51.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有啦啦队吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.05,0:17:56.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外婆喝茶吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.01,0:17:59.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一马 开开窗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.89,0:18:01.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有窗帘
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.10,0:18:07.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这几个孩子要干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.53,0:18:24.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一小会的话不要紧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.83,0:18:27.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧 让你外婆也看看
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.67,0:18:32.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们想干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.01,0:18:40.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初次见面 我们是男子啦啦队BREAKERS
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.43,0:18:42.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.18,0:18:45.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.52,0:18:48.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.94,0:18:52.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,LET'S GO BREAKERS
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.94,0:18:54.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.31,0:19:12.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,LET'S GO GO
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.19,0:19:16.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,命志院 HEY COME ON
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.48,0:19:17.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,WE ARE BREAKERS
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.62,0:19:27.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO BREAKERS
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.30,0:19:43.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO BREAKERS
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.06,0:19:53.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外婆 我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.60,0:19:57.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多亏了外婆 妈妈 还有老爸
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.19,0:19:59.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才有了那么多...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.78,0:20:04.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们都是我的同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.59,0:20:22.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你们 你们鼓舞了我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.09,0:20:25.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦队就是这样的运动啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.01,0:20:27.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一你自己就这样说过
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.64,0:20:30.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.47,0:20:33.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从明天起要来训练啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.68,0:20:36.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长不在 队里都没人管
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.23,0:20:37.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.82,0:20:40.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去 一定去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.07,0:20:45.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和你们在一起 成了我继续啦啦队的理由
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.62,0:20:56.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 冬季大三角
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.50,0:20:57.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不觉得冷吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.13,0:20:58.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.63,0:21:01.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再看一会星星吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.34,0:21:04.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.84,0:21:07.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会赢的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.56,0:21:12.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为有大家为我加油
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.52,0:21:14.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会再输了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.44,0:21:19.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一果然厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.44,0:21:23.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毕竟一个人克服了那么多困难
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.28,0:21:24.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.36,0:21:28.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一辈子都赢不过你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.49,0:21:32.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明反省笔记上教练写了「赢过阿一」来着
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.20,0:21:34.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.00,0:21:37.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 阿晴会赢过我的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.75,0:21:41.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会比我先交上女朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.81,0:21:43.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说这个干什么...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.65,0:21:47.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和千裕怎么样了 快说说
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.44,0:21:48.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没怎么样啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.03,0:21:49.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.58,0:21:55.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.16,0:22:02.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,堂本队长 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.34,0:22:05.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.59,0:22:09.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,BREAKERS？ 他们要参加啦啦队大赛？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.22,0:22:13.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的假的 也就是说那小子...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.60,0:22:15.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,德川翔也要出场吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.94,0:22:22.92,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(610.714,502.286)}{\c&HD59FE5&}太阳之泪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.94,0:22:22.92,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(638.143,522.571)}{\c&HE4DB75&}太阳之泪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.94,0:22:22.92,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(629,515)}太阳之泪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.26,0:22:24.39,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.72,0:22:26.02,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.47,0:22:27.64,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,JUST DO IT
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.73,0:22:30.39,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,LET'S GO BREAKERS
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.77,0:22:36.07,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,不由自主地大声回应
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.23,0:22:39.65,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,崭新大门打开的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.78,0:22:42.74,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,就像紧紧握住的拳头
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.91,0:22:46.08,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,决意坚定地响起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.37,0:22:49.54,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,想要散发的能量 一直在等待
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.62,0:22:52.88,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,说实话感觉能改变些什么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.96,0:22:55.80,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,你总是在寻找
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.92,0:22:59.21,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,有趣的事情对吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.42,0:23:02.68,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,没有自信＜OH MY GOD！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.76,0:23:05.93,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,自暴自弃＜OH MY PRIDE！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.97,0:23:07.81,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,那天的自己 不要输
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.89,0:23:09.39,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,送上应援的呼喊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.52,0:23:14.02,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,加油打气的动作＜LET'S DANCE TOGETHER！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.15,0:23:17.40,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,YES FLY HIGH FLY DIVE 起飞吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.53,0:23:20.99,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,垂头丧气抱怨「到极限了」＜NO！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.07,0:23:24.32,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,BREAK UP BREAK OUT 打破极限＜YES！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.41,0:23:27.66,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,向彼此微笑 流下汗水 SHOW YOUR GUTS ＜GUTS！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.74,0:23:30.83,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,向着晴空＜JUMP！JUMP！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.95,0:23:34.17,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,胜利的姿势＜高V！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.25,0:23:37.30,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,连同心一起抓住
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.42,0:23:41.13,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,向着邂逅闪耀笑容的瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.22,0:23:44.05,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.18,0:23:48.68,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.77,0:22:36.07,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,思わず大きな返事してたんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.23,0:22:39.65,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,新しい扉ひらく声は
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.78,0:22:42.74,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ぎゅっと握ったこぶしみたいだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.91,0:22:46.08,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,頼もしそうに響く決意
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.37,0:22:49.54,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,弾けたいエネルギー　ずっと待ってたんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.62,0:22:52.88,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ぶっちゃけたら何かを　変えられる気がして
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.96,0:22:55.80,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,おもしろそうなこといつだって
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.92,0:22:59.21,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,探してきたんだろ？そうだろ？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.42,0:23:02.68,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,自信なくて＜OH MY GOD！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.76,0:23:05.93,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ふてくされてた＜OH MY PRIDE！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.97,0:23:07.81,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,あの日の自分＜負けるな！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.89,0:23:09.39,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,エールを＜おくろう！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.52,0:23:14.02,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,元気づけるモーション＜LET'S DANCE TOGETHER！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.15,0:23:17.40,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,YES！FLY HIGH FLY DIVE　とびだせ！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.53,0:23:20.99,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,「もう限界」なんてうなだれは＜NO！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.07,0:23:24.32,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,BREAK UP BREAK OUT　壊しちゃえばいい＜YES！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.41,0:23:27.66,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,笑いあって　汗をかいてSHOW YOUR GUTS！＜GUTS！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.74,0:23:30.83,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,青空へ＜JUMP！JUMP！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.95,0:23:34.17,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,勝利のポーズ＜HIGH V！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.25,0:23:37.30,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,心ごと掴め！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.42,0:23:41.13,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,キラめく笑顔に出会える瞬間へ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.52,0:23:55.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题 能够集中精神
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.15,0:23:57.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,集中 集中
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.60,0:24:01.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,集中 集中
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.07,0:23:59.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴这是怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.78,0:24:00.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.03,0:24:02.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,越是正常人越容易崩溃
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.04,0:24:02.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,集中 集中
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.90,0:24:04.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,集中 集中
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.36,0:24:05.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,炖牛肉...好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.36,0:24:05.87,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,注：集中：しゅうちゅう(shuuchuu);炖牛肉：ビーフ・シチュー(biif shichuu)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.24,0:24:08.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一集 想对你说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.33,0:24:10.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
